[3;2m◉ Thought · 2 lines[0m                                                             [0m
                                                                                
[1m[7m●[27m [0mThe cache is keyed by **width**.                                              [0m
[1m┃[0m                                                                               
[1m┃[0m A resize changes the width, so every entry misses once.                       
[1m┃[0m                                                                               
[1m┃[0m After that the new width is cached again.                                     
                                                                                
